question:
What is the execution order of middleware?
```javascript
app.use((req, res, next) => {
  console.log('first');
  next();
});
app.use((req, res, next) => {
  console.log('second');
  next();
});
app.get('/', (req, res) => {
  res.send('response');
});
```

What happens if you forget to call next() in middleware?
```javascript
app.use((req, res, next) => {
  console.log('middleware');
  // missing next()
});
app.get('/', (req, res) => {
  res.send('hello');
});
```

How does Express match routes with path parameters?
```javascript
app.get('/users/:id/posts/:postId', (req, res) => {
  console.log(req.params.id, req.params.postId);
});
// GET /users/123/posts/456
```

What is the difference between app.use and app.get?
```javascript
app.use('/api', (req, res, next) => console.log('use'));
app.get('/api/data', (req, res) => console.log('get'));
```

How should you structure error handling in Express?
```javascript
app.get('/data', async (req, res) => {
  const data = await fetchData();
  res.json(data);
});
```

What is the effect of res.status(201).json(data)?
```javascript
res.status(201).json({id: 1});
console.log('after json');
```

When should you use Express router?
```javascript
const router = express.Router();
router.get('/', (req, res) => res.send('home'));
router.post('/', (req, res) => res.send('create'));
app.use('/api', router);
```

What does app.use(express.json()) do?
```javascript
app.use(express.json());
app.post('/data', (req, res) => {
  console.log(typeof req.body);
});
```

What is the correct way to send a file download?
```javascript
app.get('/download/:file', (req, res) => {
  res.download('./files/' + req.params.file);
});
```
